rspsdr (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * Live spectrum and rolling waterfall with auto-tracking levels, nine
    colour maps, 1x-16x zoom and selectable waterfall resolution.
  * AM, SAM, USB, LSB, CW and NFM demodulation with the passband drawn where
    the demodulator really puts it.
  * Audio AGC, squelch, and spectral-subtraction noise reduction.
  * Tuning, filter width, CW pitch, RF/IF gain, tuner bandwidth and FFT size
    controls, memory channels, band jumping and presets.
  * Headless modes: --check, --selftest, --wav, --memories, --screenshot.

